[8539]={["atomIDs"]={"8539:description:1-68","8539:description:71-126","8539:description:129-190","8539:objective:1-99","8539:objective:102-176"},["opening"]="Reinforcements to the western hive assault brought a separate target list. The hive sisters formed this assignment's focus, with thirty required before reporting to command.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to fulfill the hive-sister task and return its briefing.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} reported completion to Mar'alith.",["sourceHash"]="3affae40f37a88d651eaa9ea4c634417a2bc3fec89d4d91cbfc1811a1b9c2d9c",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8540]={["atomIDs"]={"8540:description:1-91","8540:description:94-177","8540:objective:1-94","8540:objective:97-175"},["opening"]="The Hold's mounted guards lacked ornate mithril boots. A small, immediate batch was requested through a numbered logistics briefing rather than a claim that the division was already equipped.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to deliver three boots and the briefing.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} fulfilled Kozus's boot requisition.",["sourceHash"]="20821b99f45364c3533b7020148451761111db7f0556a13a8b2a30627cba94d1",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8541]={["atomIDs"]={"8541:description:1-62","8541:description:65-148","8541:objective:1-151","8541:objective:154-233"},["opening"]="The guard's shortage extended to grinding stones. Three weights were needed together, making the requisition a balanced supply of ten each rather than an unspecified pile.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to bring all thirty stones and the briefing.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the grinding-stone order.",["sourceHash"]="51bb14f008cfd620867ce9c0ed3115a8112906082eef279cc09255b90c8ea403",["sourceRaceMask"]="77",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8542]={["atomIDs"]={"8542:description:1-93","8542:description:95-179","8542:description:181-325","8542:description:327-365","8542:description:370-442","8542:description:444-491","8542:objective:1-70"},["editorialVersion"]=2,["endingAtomIDs"]={"8542:completion:1-30","8542:completion:32-93"},["opening"]="Grunt Maug would prefer sharpening weapons to waiting for war. His assigned part in the preparations is collecting tin, whether or not patience comes easily to him.",["pending"]="{actor} would bring Maug twenty Tin Bars.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the tin required by Maug's commission.",["sourceHash"]="028cdf80bb2f4682f04f88b5595039552ff7a8b0cf176e7ed5c1dd442516186b",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8543]={["atomIDs"]={"8543:description:1-52","8543:description:54-186","8543:description:188-228","8543:description:233-236","8543:description:238-295","8543:objective:1-43"},["editorialVersion"]=2,["endingAtomIDs"]={"8543:completion:1-13","8543:completion:15-60","8543:completion:62-140","8543:completion:142-239","8543:completion:244-275"},["opening"]="Maug's restless waiting has not ended the demand for tin. Another stack will keep his assigned collection moving toward the Horde's needs.",["pending"]="{actor} would supply twenty more Tin Bars.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed Maug's additional tin request.",["sourceHash"]="649e1765cff48cd79c7f3ed1bb8d03ec1a98481d5b1f96f08f46c6eed6c9068b",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8544]={["atomIDs"]={"8544:description:1-131","8544:description:136-293","8544:objective:1-116","8544:objective:119-208"},["editorialVersion"]=2,["endingAtomIDs"]={"8544:completion:1-110","8544:completion:112-209"},["opening"]="Andorgos compares mortal pauldrons with a dragon's wings. Command bindings, two Night idols and matched stone and clay scarabs can become Conqueror's Spaulders for someone neutral to the Brood.",["pending"]="{actor} would supply those components and the required standing.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the Conqueror's Spaulders exchange.",["sourceHash"]="a7012b4cb28a5414a789fb99203129b32cf0a295b51326b3bb4552a523425b66",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8545]={["atomIDs"]={"8545:description:1-72","8545:description:74-122","8545:description:124-244","8545:description:246-272","8545:description:277-371","8545:description:373-411","8545:objective:1-87"},["editorialVersion"]=2,["endingAtomIDs"]={"8545:completion:1-39","8545:completion:41-140","8545:completion:142-197","8545:completion:202-326"},["opening"]="T'kelah is collecting mithril for the Horde's coming equipment. He cannot build up that reserve without contributors bringing the metal to his station.",["pending"]="{actor} would bring T'kelah twenty Mithril Bars.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} supplied the first mithril contribution.",["sourceHash"]="5f5a1c4355cf760cb695874b1f50d0c0ad668f1422ac9ee267cea5c9f6ad78ff",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8546]={["atomIDs"]={"8546:description:1-32","8546:description:34-86","8546:description:88-239","8546:description:244-317","8546:description:319-360","8546:description:362-386","8546:objective:1-87"},["editorialVersion"]=2,["endingAtomIDs"]={"8546:completion:1-21","8546:completion:23-108","8546:completion:110-139","8546:completion:141-235"},["opening"]="T'kelah still has weapons and armor in mind as the mithril quota continues. Another twenty bars move the material stack forward without declaring the war ready.",["pending"]="{actor} would supply twenty additional Mithril Bars.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the further mithril delivery.",["sourceHash"]="6a48d4ea2815ad13f66946c1b22806588ddee04fa6b7ef11d6911277ef3465ca",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8548]={["atomIDs"]={"8548:description:1-132","8548:description:137-169","8548:description:172-313","8548:objective:1-130","8548:objective:133-228"},["opening"]="Vargus explained that badges were usable proof of service across combat, supply and tactics. Friendly standing and a particular balance of badges opened this first gear exchange.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to present five combat, three logistics and seven tactical badges.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the friendly-standing exchange.",["sourceHash"]="92433a8e66df16af30c897c3886c996806f0ee5a4d7783b0a2fbcf42472733ec",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8549]={["atomIDs"]={"8549:description:1-60","8549:description:62-137","8549:description:139-194","8549:description:199-328","8549:description:330-374","8549:description:376-446","8549:description:448-470","8549:objective:1-84"},["editorialVersion"]=2,["endingAtomIDs"]={"8549:completion:1-45","8549:completion:47-105"},["opening"]="Proudfeather sees preparation for Ahn'Qiraj as a trial of the generation facing it. Peacebloom collected now can become potions for the battles still ahead.",["pending"]="{actor} would bring Proudfeather twenty Peacebloom.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} supplied the herb bundle for the Horde effort.",["sourceHash"]="3ea8d377982c2841471b6afedbca1dc8646a5f92e6e2e3d3891442e49871eae7",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8550]={["atomIDs"]={"8550:description:1-22","8550:description:24-119","8550:description:121-226","8550:description:228-254","8550:description:256-389","8550:description:391-491","8550:objective:1-84"},["editorialVersion"]=2,["endingAtomIDs"]={"8550:completion:1-41","8550:completion:43-150","8550:completion:152-227","8550:completion:229-358"},["opening"]="Proudfeather's potion makers still need Peacebloom. The next bundle can support the production of potions and elixirs for battles still ahead.",["pending"]="{actor} would deliver twenty more Peacebloom.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the renewed Peacebloom donation.",["sourceHash"]="e7b94c7ccef1e737a3b8a149d9821b0351e7e6bc5374ae104b98d5870f6bbb03",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8551]={["atomIDs"]={"8551:description:1-68","8551:description:71-124","8551:description:129-136","8551:description:141-174","8551:description:177-252","8551:description:255-311","8551:description:314-349","8551:description:352-361","8551:description:366-411","8551:description:414-444","8551:description:447-500","8551:objective:1-54"},["opening"]="Gorlash had taken Smotts' captain's chest after sea giants wrecked his ship and killed the crew. Returned to Booty Bay in a lifeboat, the ruined captain asked for his property back from the giant on the eastern coast.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to recover Smotts' Chest for Captain Hecklebury Smotts.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered Smotts' Chest to Captain Hecklebury Smotts.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="17a3419d2ac961686ac706df42d030915f46c370345b82638c685b0eefc02259",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8552]={["aftermath"]="Smotts recognized his sash and inferred that Mok'rash must have fallen. He named the giant among those that had destroyed his ships, while the record of the turn-in itself established only the sash's return.",["atomIDs"]={"8552:description:1-62","8552:objective:1-41"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"8552:completion:1-22","8552:completion:24-30","8552:completion:32-75","8552:completion:77-83","8552:completion:88-201","8552:completion:206-217","8552:completion:222-247"},["opening"]="The fine sash carried a small identifying mark: HS embroidered along the hem. Those initials offered the lead for returning it to its owner.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to return the Monogrammed Sash to its owner.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned the Monogrammed Sash to Captain Hecklebury Smotts.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="32f9635f0e9b9467fe7d8cb091457cd268c2cceaec71d2a8de668a27c120bf8d",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8553]={["atomIDs"]={"8553:description:1-61","8553:description:64-155","8553:description:158-190","8553:description:193-275","8553:description:280-339","8553:description:344-381","8553:description:386-405","8553:description:408-475","8553:description:478-508","8553:objective:1-20"},["opening"]="The loss of Smotts' Revenge had ended another attempt to face the sea giants. Negolash stole the cutlass in that defeat, and Sprogger, the cook who survived it, might know how to find him.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to consult Sprogger about the missing cutlass.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} spoke with Sprogger about Negolash.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="8a7f87624ea88d9575ab8c5b4e921531ac490600490c8b253331331858e5c1f5",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8554]={["aftermath"]="Smotts acknowledged his recovered cutlass and offered a place aboard a future ship, should he acquire one. The offer did not claim a new voyage had begun.",["atomIDs"]={"8554:description:1-27","8554:description:32-105","8554:description:108-155","8554:description:158-211","8554:description:214-294","8554:description:299-376","8554:description:379-442","8554:description:445-500","8554:objective:1-94","8554:objective:99-174"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"8554:completion:1-33","8554:completion:35-65","8554:completion:67-134","8554:completion:139-148","8554:completion:150-245"},["opening"]="Sprogger proposed tempting Negolash with the food he had sought aboard the wrecked ship. The old lifeboat would hold wine and buzzard wings, drawing the giant into reach of the effort to recover Smotts' cutlass.",["pending"]="{actor} would prepare the lifeboat lure, confront Negolash and return the cutlass.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the Negolash lure assignment and delivered Smotts' Cutlass to Captain Hecklebury Smotts.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="8a015b516d379c6e054d29bf7fe02de4d150a0f50f54f3ac72ed95012e5b3aeb",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
