[8711]={["atomIDs"]={"8711:description:1-184","8711:description:189-306","8711:description:309-420","8711:objective:1-108","8711:objective:111-194"},["editorialVersion"]=2,["endingAtomIDs"]={"8711:completion:1-21","8711:completion:23-50","8711:completion:52-74","8711:completion:79-99","8711:completion:101-156"},["opening"]="For the Blade of Eternal Justice, Haro names a spiked hilt and Amber idols. Bronze and ivory scarabs complete the components required from an Exalted ally of the Circle.",["pending"]="{actor} would bring the hilt and the specified materials.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the Eternal Justice blade exchange.",["sourceHash"]="57e455c74f68a1c4659cca75471776b2547f5dcc08559eefd024b540b708c415",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8712]={["atomIDs"]={"8712:description:1-184","8712:description:189-306","8712:description:309-420","8712:objective:1-106","8712:objective:109-192"},["editorialVersion"]=2,["endingAtomIDs"]={"8712:completion:1-21","8712:completion:23-50","8712:completion:52-74","8712:completion:79-99","8712:completion:101-156"},["opening"]="The Scythe of the Unseen Path would turn Qiraji craft against its makers. Haro requires a spiked hilt, Azure idols, silver and bone scarabs, and Exalted standing.",["pending"]="{actor} would supply the hilt, two idols and five of each scarab kind.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} fulfilled the Unseen Path scythe commission.",["sourceHash"]="616d67ef9a8f8f6414f38d4631657f55bc94915ab0c88560bf130ff1bce50c55",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8728]={["aftermath"]="Narain honored the bargain while questioning the effort involved in the proposed fishing. His craft was part of an undertaking larger than he appeared willing to discuss.",["atomIDs"]={"8728:description:1-45","8728:description:47-83","8728:description:88-162","8728:description:167-295","8728:description:297-349","8728:description:354-446","8728:description:451-497","8728:objective:1-135"},["bridge"]="The chapters had returned as a whole book. Narain could now consider the buoy's specifications, but crafting it still demanded arcanite, elementium and rare gems.",["bridgeFrom"]=8620,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["endingAtomIDs"]={"8728:completion:1-17","8728:completion:19-78","8728:completion:80-144"},["opening"]="Narain believed he could craft the required arcanite buoy, though he framed his confidence as ninety-nine percent. The materials were the remaining obstacle: arcanite, elementium and two kinds of rare gem.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to obtain twenty Arcanite Bars, ten Elementium Ore, ten Azerothian Diamonds and ten Blue Sapphires.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered Narain's requested arcanite, elementium, diamonds and sapphires.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="ab32f6d51bdaed560c92cc8f4c44b5ee0bd296ba412bea7fb8f0894a5d466869",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8729]={["aftermath"]="Anachronos anticipated being able to reform the scepter soon.",["atomIDs"]={"8729:description:1-31","8729:description:33-84","8729:description:86-133","8729:description:138-290","8729:description:295-361","8729:description:366-400","8729:description:405-482","8729:objective:1-80"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"8729:completion:1-14","8729:completion:16-79"},["opening"]="Narain's buoy was to be cast into the storm bay's wreck-strewn maelstrom. He belatedly warned of Maws and directed any recovered shard onward to Anachronos.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to use the buoy and take the shard onward.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the encounter and reached Anachronos.",["sourceHash"]="bd6fd45599128150a453a3f6bb2a768afa8122c92bb0518aaef3f771bb7c5130",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8730]={["atomIDs"]={"8730:description:1-20","8730:description:22-154","8730:description:156-197","8730:description:202-229","8730:description:240-276","8730:description:281-303","8730:description:305-340","8730:description:342-356","8730:objective:1-48","8730:objective:50-126","8730:objective:128-166"},["editorialVersion"]=2,["endingAtomIDs"]={"8730:completion:1-40","8730:completion:42-97","8730:completion:99-133","8730:completion:138-204","8730:completion:206-219"},["opening"]="Vaelastrasz has lost the red shard to Nefarius at the moment a champion finally appears. Nefarius intends to destroy it, leaving only five hours to recover it from Nefarian and reach Anachronos.",["pending"]="{actor} would recover the Red Scepter Shard within the time allowed.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned the red shard to Anachronos.",["sourceHash"]="14ac9efce77eccb04bbb61af8a86c32b1eafc79fe55c82d4da3126b777839a6f",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8731]={["aftermath"]="Kaldon noted that Krug had signed in silithid blood and assigned more advanced work.",["atomIDs"]={"8731:description:1-14","8731:description:17-114","8731:description:121-191","8731:description:196-262","8731:description:265-318","8731:description:323-386","8731:description:389-446","8731:objective:1-78","8731:objective:81-206","8731:objective:211-311"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"8731:completion:1-50","8731:completion:52-84","8731:completion:89-102","8731:completion:104-181","8731:completion:186-271"},["opening"]="Kaldon sent Horde field service toward Krug's legion outside the southern hive. Tension with the Ironforge force made keeping the contingents apart an explicit part of his warning.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to return with the legion's signed papers.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered proof of field service.",["sourceHash"]="c5f0374f2e498b8780cdeae5c602662f147eacbf207d443eab7239aaf3d4d394",["sourceRaceMask"]="178",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8733]={["atomIDs"]={"8733:description:1-38","8733:description:40-124","8733:description:126-166","8733:description:168-238","8733:description:243-262","8733:description:264-322","8733:description:324-425","8733:description:430-447","8733:description:452-502","8733:objective:1-106"},["editorialVersion"]=2,["endingAtomIDs"]={"8733:completion:1-50","8733:completion:52-117"},["opening"]="Malfurion describes recovering the green shard as a chance to redeem Eranikus from the Old Gods' taint. His agent outside Darnassus can alert Tyrande while keeping the plans from Staghelm.",["pending"]="{actor} would find Malfurion's agent outside Darnassus.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} reached the forest wisp carrying Malfurion's plans.",["sourceHash"]="7ae18c91dbb95aa381abe7d95af6ff67e8bf9d00f5c2b2dcda718be72ea8b848",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8734]={["atomIDs"]={"8734:description:1-32","8734:description:34-88","8734:description:93-153","8734:description:155-219","8734:description:224-250","8734:objective:1-52"},["opening"]="The forest wisp promised that Tyrande would be notified. Prepared by Stormrage for this contingency, it sent the next part of the effort to Keeper Remulos in Moonglade for instructions about summoning Eranikus.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to consult Keeper Remulos in Moonglade.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} spoke with Keeper Remulos in Moonglade.",["sourceHash"]="f63f7c6ffc97479fcf99122a8b45b337b387c19b1873d13a9c22fc0e2706905b",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8735]={["aftermath"]="Remulos questioned whether anyone was prepared for what the gathered fragments would invoke. Duty to Malfurion committed him to proceed despite that uncertainty.",["atomIDs"]={"8735:description:1-53","8735:description:55-119","8735:description:121-184","8735:description:186-237","8735:objective:1-115","8735:objective:117-192"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"8735:completion:1-17","8735:completion:19-72","8735:completion:74-89","8735:completion:91-122","8735:completion:124-140"},["opening"]="Remulos called for fragments of Nightmare corruption from the four Dream portals. Dragonkin near each site carried the material needed for the next part of the undertaking.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to obtain a Fragment of the Nightmare's Corruption from each of the four portals.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the four portal fragments to Keeper Remulos.",["sourceHash"]="0019b3c17022d1efd0245276cc3a128e770697d4794041deefd4eee012e42a9a",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8736]={["aftermath"]="Remulos declared Eranikus redeemed and returning to the Dream to address his own wrongs. He saw the dragon as a future ally to Malfurion and his own father.",["atomIDs"]={"8736:description:1-39","8736:description:41-77","8736:description:82-135","8736:description:137-216","8736:description:221-232","8736:description:234-271","8736:objective:1-32","8736:objective:34-66","8736:objective:68-88","8736:objective:90-105","8736:objective:107-120"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"8736:completion:1-19","8736:completion:21-86","8736:completion:88-147","8736:completion:152-213","8736:completion:215-287"},["opening"]="Remulos demanded restraint toward Eranikus: redemption required the dragon to survive. Tyrande was on her way, and Nighthaven had to hold against the attack while the keeper remained alive.",["pending"]="{actor} would defend Nighthaven and Remulos, awaiting Tyrande without slaying Eranikus.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the defense of Nighthaven under Remulos's requirement to preserve Eranikus.",["sourceHash"]="715377ff6eb349bac76591eebb6cba77409c3c30585a645859c53e7a6c3ad5bb",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8737]={["atomIDs"]={"8737:description:1-118","8737:description:121-231","8737:description:236-312","8737:objective:1-82","8737:objective:85-161"},["opening"]="The azure templar was another outside threat maintained in view during the war. The tactical paper required summoning, defeat and a report rather than merely finding the cult's ritual site.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to complete the azure encounter with its briefing.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} returned to Bor after the assigned confrontation.",["sourceHash"]="5776b5b6f50cd1b8acd6c97ffa2e7798ae8f77c6f16cac673aa0e8e4cc6703e6",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8738]={["atomIDs"]={"8738:description:1-79","8738:description:82-171","8738:description:174-210","8738:description:213-282","8738:objective:1-129","8738:objective:132-210"},["opening"]="Landion's days inside Hive'Regal had produced observations urgently needed at the Hold. Retrieving his report would connect the scout's isolated work to Proudhorn's next decisions.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to bring Landion's report and the briefing.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the southern hive's intelligence.",["sourceHash"]="d45646f783f9a02a85bd5257634a032163731f5c2376c1bfae904d926dfeee19",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8739]={["atomIDs"]={"8739:description:1-79","8739:description:82-168","8739:description:171-207","8739:description:210-279","8739:objective:1-125","8739:objective:128-207"},["opening"]="Jalia had watched the silithid movements at Hive'Ashi for several days. Her written report was urgently needed at the Hold, and the courier also had to carry the matching tactical briefing.",["pending"]="{actor} meant to recover Jalia's report and return.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} brought the northern hive intelligence to Proudhorn.",["sourceHash"]="825165adc939ec7ca33fd63791d882f3b3998e781fb303195dd34b9966c99a04",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8740]={["aftermath"]="Proudhorn acknowledged that their attacks had caused unacceptable patrol losses.",["atomIDs"]={"8740:description:1-164","8740:description:169-272","8740:description:275-331","8740:objective:1-54","8740:objective:57-114","8740:objective:117-194"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"8740:completion:1-14","8740:completion:16-106","8740:completion:108-135"},["opening"]="Mounted cultists operated beyond the Hold's reach, picking off small patrols and caravans. The task named Morna and five marauders as the force to stop.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to confront the mounted band and return the briefing.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the marauder assignment.",["sourceHash"]="b9e226203a5b8ee55764d22b2013c00e72c1b0a93a2c534f61aa62e5a83a7915",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8741]={["atomIDs"]={"8741:description:1-34","8741:description:36-101","8741:objective:1-77"},["bridge"]="The defense of Nighthaven had reached its recorded conclusion. Remulos sent the Green Scepter Shard to Anachronos at the Caverns of Time, carrying the undertaking out of Moonglade and toward Tanaris.",["bridgeFrom"]=8736,["bridgeReplacesSetup"]=true,["opening"]="The Green Scepter Shard was ready to leave Moonglade. Remulos sent it onward to Anachronos, who awaited the return at the Caverns of Time in Tanaris.",["pending"]="{actor} planned to bring the Green Scepter Shard to Anachronos.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} delivered the Green Scepter Shard to Anachronos at the Caverns of Time.",["sourceHash"]="a872495d6be4fe650d997ee57c600340861e56fe9fc5151cf93f9f4bf9b13174",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8742]={["aftermath"]="Anachronos declared the Scepter whole again, but required waiting for the Horde and Alliance armies in Silithus before ringing the Scarab Gong. Completion of this exchange did not record the gates opened.",["atomIDs"]={"8742:description:1-75","8742:description:77-121","8742:description:126-150","8742:description:152-179","8742:description:181-211","8742:description:216-286","8742:description:288-394"},["endingAtomIDs"]={"8742:completion:1-57","8742:completion:62-97","8742:completion:99-153","8742:completion:155-271"},["opening"]="Anachronos spoke of a thousand-year destiny and a challenge to C'Thun's prophecy. The Scepter of the Shifting Sands was promised once the appointed champion declared readiness.",["pending"]="{actor} intended to tell Anachronos of readiness to proceed.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the readiness exchange with Anachronos.",["sourceClassMask"]="?",["sourceHash"]="58acdd3fff682b219d2026f76ad92ac6490a30b67683b3d14bcb6e314bd89fd6",["sourceRaceMask"]="?",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8746]={["atomIDs"]={"8746:description:1-20","8746:description:23-61","8746:description:66-156","8746:description:159-240","8746:description:243-318","8746:description:321-362","8746:description:367-486","8746:description:491-504","8746:objective:1-25","8746:objective:28-96","8746:objective:101-270","8746:objective:275-365"},["editorialVersion"]=2,["endingAtomIDs"]={"8746:completion:1-11","8746:completion:14-20","8746:completion:25-130","8746:completion:133-178","8746:completion:181-262","8746:completion:265-278","8746:completion:283-291","8746:completion:293-350","8746:completion:353-438","8746:completion:441-458"},["opening"]="Two separate ransom letters claim Metzen, one of Great-father Winter's reindeer. Kaymard asks a rescuer to follow their clues and use reindeer dust to release the captive.",["pending"]="{actor} would free Metzen and return the dust pouch to Kaymard.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed Metzen's rescue and returned the pouch.",["sourceHash"]="5b320601321f0e14620b3d8631c7f6f7bcdd23b3573351955ae4c02393f088c5",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8762]={["atomIDs"]={"8762:description:1-20","8762:description:23-61","8762:description:66-155","8762:description:158-239","8762:description:242-317","8762:description:320-361","8762:description:366-485","8762:description:490-503","8762:objective:1-25","8762:objective:28-96","8762:objective:101-270","8762:objective:275-366"},["editorialVersion"]=2,["endingAtomIDs"]={"8762:completion:1-11","8762:completion:14-20","8762:completion:25-129","8762:completion:132-177","8762:completion:180-261","8762:completion:264-277","8762:completion:282-290","8762:completion:292-349","8762:completion:352-437","8762:completion:440-457"},["opening"]="Wulmort faces a holiday crisis after Metzen's kidnapping and competing ransom claims. The letters provide leads, while the supplied dust is meant to break the reindeer's bonds.",["pending"]="{actor} would free Metzen and bring the dust pouch back to Wulmort.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} carried out the rescue and returned the pouch.",["sourceHash"]="cbde5ee436662e6a6d29ea58311837d66d1fe0664fb49df718bf4623228eacb1",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
[8763]={["atomIDs"]={"8763:description:1-9","8763:description:11-105","8763:description:110-182","8763:description:185-245","8763:description:248-283","8763:description:285-314","8763:description:319-383","8763:description:386-455","8763:description:458-505","8763:objective:1-117"},["editorialVersion"]=2,["endingAtomIDs"]={"8763:completion:1-86","8763:completion:88-189","8763:completion:191-247"},["opening"]="Wulmort shares a Smokywood secret with the holiday's helper: a machine preserves holly beyond the season. A master cook may use it with Deeprock Salt and five gold.",["pending"]="{actor} would bring the salt and payment to a Holly Preserver.",["referenceStatus"]="UNVERIFIED_CLIENT_REFERENCE",["result"]="{actor} completed the Holly Preserver transaction.",["sourceHash"]="8493ebf9a2caa38bed28d2a93759a58acbd5e9bf0931554c283526066c7df818",["sourceURL"]="https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questdb/files/9014639"},
